[2026-03-14T20:45:37.728Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BYZBEUEUZFsy2s9VeJe4VB","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have comprehensive information. Let me create a summary document:\n\n## Summary: Airbnb Clone App Structure and Test Information\n\n### 1. **App Directory Name**\n- **Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 2. **Test Structure**\n\n**Test Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`\n\n**Existing Test Files:**\n- `my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - Tests for TripsTabs component (tab switching, empty states, filtering)\n- `my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - Tests for TripCard component (display, status badges, cancel/review buttons)\n- `booking-card.spec.ts` - Tests for BookingCard component on property detail pages\n- `auth.spec.ts` - Authentication tests\n- `search.spec.ts` - Search functionality tests\n- `property-detail.spec.ts` - Property detail page tests\n- `property-grid.spec.ts` - Property grid tests\n- `reviews-section.spec.ts` - Reviews section tests\n- `amenities-list.spec.ts` - Amenities list tests\n- `image-gallery.spec.ts` - Image gallery tests\n- `pagination.spec.ts` - Pagination tests\n- `category-filter.spec.ts` - Category filter tests\n- `favorite-button.spec.ts` - Favorite button tests\n- `filters-panel.spec.ts` - Filters panel tests\n- `host-info-card.spec.ts` - Host info card tests\n\n### 3. **Playwright Config**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- Test directory: './tests'\n- Timeout: 60000ms\n- Expect timeout: 10000ms\n- Workers: 1 (serial execution)\n- Base URL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- WebServer: netlify dev on port 8888\n- Reporter: Replay reporter + JSON + HTML reports\n- Trace: on-first-retry\n```\n\n### 4. **Test Entries in docs/tests.md**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n\n**\"Write Review button\" related tests:**\n- Line 690-705: Write Review button tests (appears on completed bookings without review, disappears after submitting, doesn't appear on pending/confirmed/cancelled)\n- Line 1355: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n\n**\"Trip cards ordered by check-in\" test:**\n- Line 707-709: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date in chronological order\n\n**\"Cancel button/dialog\" related tests:**\n- Line 674-688: Cancel button visibility tests (pending/confirmed/completed/cancelled)\n- Line 713-745: CancelBookingDialog tests (confirmation, dismissal, state persistence, context display)\n\n**Booking status tests:**\n- Line 661-663: Trip card displays correct status badge colors (yellow=pending, green=confirmed, red=cancelled, blue=completed)\n- Line 662-663: Status badge color requirements\n\n### 5. **My Trips Page Component**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Requires login (redirects to /login if not authenticated)\n- Fetches user bookings via `fetchUserBookings` thunk\n- Manages cancel dialog state via `cancelTarget` useState\n- Renders TripsTabs component passing bookings and onCancelBooking handler\n- Renders CancelBookingDialog conditionally when cancelTarget is set\n- Handles cancel confirmation via `handleCancelConfirm`\n\n### 6. **Related Components**\n\n**TripCard Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Displays booking card with property image, title, city, dates, status badge, and price\n- Status colors defined: pending (bg-status-pending/15), confirmed (bg-status-confirmed/15), cancelled, completed\n- Shows \"Cancel\" button for pending/confirmed status\n- Shows \"Write Review\" button for completed status without review (`has_review` is false)\n- Shows \"Reviewed ✓\" badge for completed status with review\n- Clicking card navigates to property detail page\n- Date format: \"Jun 15, 2026 – Jun 20, 2026\"\n\n**TripsTabs Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- filterBookings function:\n  - **Upcoming:** pending OR confirmed status AND check_in >= today, sorted by check_in ASC\n  - **Past:** completed status, sorted by check_in ASC\n  - **Cancelled:** cancelled status, sorted by check_in ASC\n- Empty state messages for each tab\n- Browse properties link on Upcoming empty state\n- Grid layout for trip cards\n\n**CancelBookingDialog Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Modal dialog with overlay backdrop\n- Shows property title and formatted date range\n- \"Keep Booking\" (dismiss) and \"Yes, Cancel\" (confirm) buttons\n- Date format in dialog: \"June 10 – June 15, 2026\"\n- Clicking overlay dismisses without action\n- Props: booking, onConfirm, onDismiss\n\n### 7. **Seed Data for Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-299)\n\n**Bookings:**\n```typescript\ne1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 | b1111111 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2025-12-15 to 2025-12-20 | 2 guests | $825 | completed\ne2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222 | b2222222 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2026-04-01 to 2026-04-07 | 6 guests | $2850 | confirmed\ne3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333 | b3333333 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2026-05-10 to 2026-05-13 | 2 guests | $650 | pending\ne4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444 | b4444444 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2025-11-01 to 2025-11-05 | 1 guest | $520 | completed\ne5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555 | b1111111 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2025-10-20 to 2025-10-22 | 2 guests | $375 | cancelled\ne6666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666 | b5555555 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2026-06-15 to 2026-06-20 | 4 guests | $1475 | confirmed\n```\n\n**Users:**\n- a3333333: Emma Wilson (guest, email: emma@example.com)\n- a4444444: Alex Rivera (guest, email: alex@example.com)\n- a1111111: Sarah Chen (host, email: sarah@example.com)\n- a2222222: Mike Johnson (host, email: mike@example.com)\n\n**Reviews (line 302-306):**\n- e1111111 has review from Emma (rating 5)\n- e4444444 has review from Alex (rating 4)\n- e3333333 (Emma's pending cabin) has NO review\n- e6666666 (Emma's confirmed townhouse) has NO review\n\n### 8. **Netlify Functions for Bookings/Trips**\n\n**Bookings Function:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- **POST /api/bookings** - Create booking\n  - Validates no overlapping confirmed/pending bookings\n  - Creates with status 'pending'\n  - Returns created booking\n  \n- **PUT /api/bookings/:id** - Update booking status\n  - Accepts: confirmed, cancelled\n  - Returns updated booking\n\n- **GET /api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}** - Fetch user's bookings\n  - Joins with properties table for property_title, property_city, property_country\n  - Joins with property_images for first image (display_order ASC)\n  - Calculates has_review boolean via EXISTS subquery\n  - Ordered by check_in ASC\n\n**Response data includes:**\n- All booking fields: id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status, special_requests, created_at\n- Enhanced fields: property_title, property_city, property_country, property_image, has_review\n\n**Host Bookings Function:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts`\n- Manages bookings for properties owned by a host\n\n### 9. **Shared Components / Dialog Components**\n\n**CancelBookingDialog** is the primary dialog used. No generic shared ConfirmDialog component exists in the codebase - each dialog is custom-built (CancelBookingDialog is specifically for cancellations).\n\n**Status Colors:**\n```typescript\n- pending: 'bg-status-pending/15 text-status-pending' (yellow)\n- confirmed: 'bg-status-confirmed/15 text-status-confirmed' (green)\n- cancelled: 'bg-status-cancelled/15 text-status-cancelled' (red)\n- completed: 'bg-status-completed/15 text-status-completed' (blue)\n```\n\n### 10. **Redux Bookings Slice**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`\n\n**Booking Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string\n  check_out: string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `createBooking` - POST /api/bookings\n- `fetchUserBookings` - GET /api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}\n- `cancelBooking` - PUT /api/bookings/:id with status 'cancelled'\n\n---\n\n**All absolute file paths provided above for reference.**"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae7d6c131a94d1f59 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 85912\ntool_uses: 40\nduration_ms: 52038</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf64fb1f-6d22-482a-898e-953cd6c2617e","uuid":"bf9fb716-051f-4561-8163-c6b68c8c3859","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the airbnb clone app in /repo/apps/. I need to understand:\n1. The app directory name\n2. The test structure (look at existing test files in e2e/ or tests/)\n3. The playwright config\n4. The docs/tests.md file for test entries related to: \"Write Review button\", \"Trip cards ordered by check-in\", \"Cancel button/dialog\", booking statuses\n5. The My Trips page component and any related components (cancel dialog, trip cards, review button)\n6. The seed data for bookings\n7. The Netlify functions related to bookings/trips\n8. Any shared components like ConfirmDialog\n\nBe thorough - read all relevant files completely.","agentId":"ae7d6c131a94d1f59","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have comprehensive information. Let me create a summary document:\n\n## Summary: Airbnb Clone App Structure and Test Information\n\n### 1. **App Directory Name**\n- **Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 2. **Test Structure**\n\n**Test Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`\n\n**Existing Test Files:**\n- `my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - Tests for TripsTabs component (tab switching, empty states, filtering)\n- `my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - Tests for TripCard component (display, status badges, cancel/review buttons)\n- `booking-card.spec.ts` - Tests for BookingCard component on property detail pages\n- `auth.spec.ts` - Authentication tests\n- `search.spec.ts` - Search functionality tests\n- `property-detail.spec.ts` - Property detail page tests\n- `property-grid.spec.ts` - Property grid tests\n- `reviews-section.spec.ts` - Reviews section tests\n- `amenities-list.spec.ts` - Amenities list tests\n- `image-gallery.spec.ts` - Image gallery tests\n- `pagination.spec.ts` - Pagination tests\n- `category-filter.spec.ts` - Category filter tests\n- `favorite-button.spec.ts` - Favorite button tests\n- `filters-panel.spec.ts` - Filters panel tests\n- `host-info-card.spec.ts` - Host info card tests\n\n### 3. **Playwright Config**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- Test directory: './tests'\n- Timeout: 60000ms\n- Expect timeout: 10000ms\n- Workers: 1 (serial execution)\n- Base URL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- WebServer: netlify dev on port 8888\n- Reporter: Replay reporter + JSON + HTML reports\n- Trace: on-first-retry\n```\n\n### 4. **Test Entries in docs/tests.md**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n\n**\"Write Review button\" related tests:**\n- Line 690-705: Write Review button tests (appears on completed bookings without review, disappears after submitting, doesn't appear on pending/confirmed/cancelled)\n- Line 1355: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n\n**\"Trip cards ordered by check-in\" test:**\n- Line 707-709: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date in chronological order\n\n**\"Cancel button/dialog\" related tests:**\n- Line 674-688: Cancel button visibility tests (pending/confirmed/completed/cancelled)\n- Line 713-745: CancelBookingDialog tests (confirmation, dismissal, state persistence, context display)\n\n**Booking status tests:**\n- Line 661-663: Trip card displays correct status badge colors (yellow=pending, green=confirmed, red=cancelled, blue=completed)\n- Line 662-663: Status badge color requirements\n\n### 5. **My Trips Page Component**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Requires login (redirects to /login if not authenticated)\n- Fetches user bookings via `fetchUserBookings` thunk\n- Manages cancel dialog state via `cancelTarget` useState\n- Renders TripsTabs component passing bookings and onCancelBooking handler\n- Renders CancelBookingDialog conditionally when cancelTarget is set\n- Handles cancel confirmation via `handleCancelConfirm`\n\n### 6. **Related Components**\n\n**TripCard Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Displays booking card with property image, title, city, dates, status badge, and price\n- Status colors defined: pending (bg-status-pending/15), confirmed (bg-status-confirmed/15), cancelled, completed\n- Shows \"Cancel\" button for pending/confirmed status\n- Shows \"Write Review\" button for completed status without review (`has_review` is false)\n- Shows \"Reviewed ✓\" badge for completed status with review\n- Clicking card navigates to property detail page\n- Date format: \"Jun 15, 2026 – Jun 20, 2026\"\n\n**TripsTabs Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- filterBookings function:\n  - **Upcoming:** pending OR confirmed status AND check_in >= today, sorted by check_in ASC\n  - **Past:** completed status, sorted by check_in ASC\n  - **Cancelled:** cancelled status, sorted by check_in ASC\n- Empty state messages for each tab\n- Browse properties link on Upcoming empty state\n- Grid layout for trip cards\n\n**CancelBookingDialog Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Modal dialog with overlay backdrop\n- Shows property title and formatted date range\n- \"Keep Booking\" (dismiss) and \"Yes, Cancel\" (confirm) buttons\n- Date format in dialog: \"June 10 – June 15, 2026\"\n- Clicking overlay dismisses without action\n- Props: booking, onConfirm, onDismiss\n\n### 7. **Seed Data for Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-299)\n\n**Bookings:**\n```typescript\ne1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 | b1111111 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2025-12-15 to 2025-12-20 | 2 guests | $825 | completed\ne2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222 | b2222222 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2026-04-01 to 2026-04-07 | 6 guests | $2850 | confirmed\ne3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333 | b3333333 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2026-05-10 to 2026-05-13 | 2 guests | $650 | pending\ne4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444 | b4444444 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2025-11-01 to 2025-11-05 | 1 guest | $520 | completed\ne5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555 | b1111111 | a4444444 (Alex) | 2025-10-20 to 2025-10-22 | 2 guests | $375 | cancelled\ne6666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666 | b5555555 | a3333333 (Emma) | 2026-06-15 to 2026-06-20 | 4 guests | $1475 | confirmed\n```\n\n**Users:**\n- a3333333: Emma Wilson (guest, email: emma@example.com)\n- a4444444: Alex Rivera (guest, email: alex@example.com)\n- a1111111: Sarah Chen (host, email: sarah@example.com)\n- a2222222: Mike Johnson (host, email: mike@example.com)\n\n**Reviews (line 302-306):**\n- e1111111 has review from Emma (rating 5)\n- e4444444 has review from Alex (rating 4)\n- e3333333 (Emma's pending cabin) has NO review\n- e6666666 (Emma's confirmed townhouse) has NO review\n\n### 8. **Netlify Functions for Bookings/Trips**\n\n**Bookings Function:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- **POST /api/bookings** - Create booking\n  - Validates no overlapping confirmed/pending bookings\n  - Creates with status 'pending'\n  - Returns created booking\n  \n- **PUT /api/bookings/:id** - Update booking status\n  - Accepts: confirmed, cancelled\n  - Returns updated booking\n\n- **GET /api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}** - Fetch user's bookings\n  - Joins with properties table for property_title, property_city, property_country\n  - Joins with property_images for first image (display_order ASC)\n  - Calculates has_review boolean via EXISTS subquery\n  - Ordered by check_in ASC\n\n**Response data includes:**\n- All booking fields: id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status, special_requests, created_at\n- Enhanced fields: property_title, property_city, property_country, property_image, has_review\n\n**Host Bookings Function:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts`\n- Manages bookings for properties owned by a host\n\n### 9. **Shared Components / Dialog Components**\n\n**CancelBookingDialog** is the primary dialog used. No generic shared ConfirmDialog component exists in the codebase - each dialog is custom-built (CancelBookingDialog is specifically for cancellations).\n\n**Status Colors:**\n```typescript\n- pending: 'bg-status-pending/15 text-status-pending' (yellow)\n- confirmed: 'bg-status-confirmed/15 text-status-confirmed' (green)\n- cancelled: 'bg-status-cancelled/15 text-status-cancelled' (red)\n- completed: 'bg-status-completed/15 text-status-completed' (blue)\n```\n\n### 10. **Redux Bookings Slice**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`\n\n**Booking Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string\n  check_out: string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `createBooking` - POST /api/bookings\n- `fetchUserBookings` - GET /api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}\n- `cancelBooking` - PUT /api/bookings/:id with status 'cancelled'\n\n---\n\n**All absolute file paths provided above for reference.**"}],"totalDurationMs":52038,"totalTokens":85912,"totalToolUseCount":40,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3313,"cache_read_input_tokens":79932,"output_tokens":2664,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3313},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
